                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino sa mulayeeya kukaka bwami bwa-Jehova mbwaakabika mumaanza aabana ba-Davida nkaambo kakuti muli banji, alimwi mweza aboombe bangolida mbaakamucitila Jeroboamu kuti babe baleza banu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
