        },
        {
          "text": "Balatuulila Jehova zipaizyo mazuba oonse cifumo amangolezya, atununkilizyo, alimwi balabika zinkwa zyakubonwa-bonwa antafule iisalalisya, akubamba ilampi lyangolida kuti mimuni yalyo iboneke mazuba oonse ciindi camangolezya, nkaambo iswe tulabamba milazyo ya-Jehova Leza wesu, anukuti inywe mwamuleka buyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
