        },
        {
          "text": "Amubone! Leza uli aswe, ulatusololela, abapaizi bakwe bali amyeembo yabo yakulizya kukwiita bantu kuti bazoomulwisye. Nubana ba-Israyeli, mutalwisyi Jehova Leza wabamauso, nkaambo tamukonzyi kuzunda pe.",
          "type": "text",
